        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leslie Skinner\n- Products: Bazooka, Stovepipe\n- Events: World War II\n- Concepts: rocket-propelled weapons, shoulder-fired missile systems, anti-tank weapons, infantry combat\n\nFacts:\n- During World War II, Leslie Skinner played a leading role in developing several rocket-propelled weapons.\n- During World War II, Leslie Skinner notably helped develop the Bazooka, the first shoulder-fired missile system.\n- The Bazooka was also referred to as the \"Stovepipe.\"\n- The Bazooka was an innovative early-generation rocket-propelled anti-tank weapon used in infantry combat.",
